---
import BaseLayout from '../../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';

const formUrl =
  'https://docs.google.com/forms/d/e/1FAIpQLSeXCQpOVROZKxKAqS4xc7RrqYxdRtd54x9ObVt-fD1KJV62cA/viewform?usp=sharing';
---

<BaseLayout
  title="Open call: Solidarity Lines"
  description="Open call for young people (aged 18-21) living in the Netherlands to join a 10-day train journey in December 2026. Travel and accommodation are covered."
  lang="en"
  showAnnouncement={false}
  alternates={{ en: '/projects/solidarity-lines/open-call', nl: '/nl/projecten/solidarity-lines/oproep' }}
>
  <section class="call">
    <div class="container narrow">
      <div class="top-row">
        <a class="back" href="/projects/solidarity-lines">&larr; Back to the project</a>
        <p class="lang-switch">
          <span aria-current="true">English</span>
          <a href="/nl/projecten/solidarity-lines/oproep" hreflang="nl">Nederlands</a>
        </p>
      </div>

      <h1>Open call for young people (aged 18–21) living in the Netherlands</h1>

      <p class="lead">
        In December 2026, the Solidara Foundation will take a group of 5
        young people on a train journey. This trip is part of the Erasmus+
        project "Solidarity Lines: Local Roots, European Routes"
        (DiscoverEU). All travel and accommodation costs are covered by the
        project.
      </p>

      <h2>The trip</h2>
      <ul class="dot-list">
        <li>
          <span class="eyebrow-dot"></span>
          <span>10 days, tentatively scheduled for December 8–17, 2026</span>
        </li>
        <li>
          <span class="eyebrow-dot"></span>
          <span>
            Route: Workum – Amsterdam – Bruges – Lille – Brussels – Workum,
            traveling entirely by train
          </span>
        </li>
        <li>
          <span class="eyebrow-dot"></span>
          <span>
            You will help plan the daily itinerary, accommodation, and safety
            arrangements
          </span>
        </li>
      </ul>

      <h2>Who is this for?</h2>
      <p>
        This trip is designed for young people who have had fewer chances to
        travel or take part in international projects, and who would benefit
        from some extra support. You don't have to prove anything. You tell
        us as much as you wish to share.
      </p>
      <p class="list-intro">You can apply if:</p>
      <ul class="dot-list">
        <li>
          <span class="eyebrow-dot"></span>
          <span>you are 18–21 years old on the trip's start date (8 December 2026)</span>
        </li>
        <li>
          <span class="eyebrow-dot"></span>
          <span>you live legally in the Netherlands, preferably in or around Workum</span>
        </li>
        <li>
          <span class="eyebrow-dot"></span>
          <span>you haven't had the chance to experience a trip like this before</span>
        </li>
        <li>
          <span class="eyebrow-dot"></span>
          <span>you are eager to explore and learn together</span>
        </li>
      </ul>
      <p>
        Do you need support, for example regarding accessibility or health?
        Let us know whenever you feel comfortable. All information is handled
        confidentially. Taking part is always voluntary.
      </p>

      <h2>How do we choose?</h2>
      <p class="list-intro">We choose on clear criteria:</p>
      <ol class="num-list">
        <li>
          You are 18–21 and would not easily be able to take part in
          international travel on your own.
        </li>
        <li>
          You face one or more barriers, for example economic, geographical,
          social or related to confidence. You decide whether you tell us.
        </li>
        <li>You are motivated to learn and reflect together with a group.</li>
        <li>
          You can commit to the preparation meetings and the follow-up
          session.
        </li>
      </ol>
      <p>
        If more people apply than there are places, we give priority to young
        people who have never travelled abroad independently, who have
        limited financial means, or for whom this trip would be a significant
        first step. We also give a little priority to young people from
        Workum and the surrounding region. We don't choose who has it
        hardest. We choose who can benefit most from the support this project
        offers. We aim for a balanced and diverse group, and all genders are
        welcome.
      </p>
      <p>
        We keep the process fair. You don't need a CV or grades. We document
        our decisions, everyone who applies receives feedback, and what you
        share about barriers stays confidential. There are 5 places.
      </p>

      <h2>What do we ask of you?</h2>
      <ul class="dot-list">
        <li>
          <span class="eyebrow-dot"></span>
          <span>
            Participation in two preparatory meetings: one in-person
            (tentatively Tuesday, November 24) and one online (tentatively
            Thursday, December 3), plus a short personal conversation.
          </span>
        </li>
        <li>
          <span class="eyebrow-dot"></span>
          <span>
            You will travel with the group for the entire duration and attend
            a follow-up/reflection session in January
          </span>
        </li>
        <li>
          <span class="eyebrow-dot"></span>
          <span>You will be eligible to receive a "Youthpass"</span>
        </li>
        <li>
          <span class="eyebrow-dot"></span>
          <span>You must have a valid ID or passport.</span>
        </li>
        <li>
          <span class="eyebrow-dot"></span>
          <span>
            You do not need to speak French or English. We will practice
            useful phrases together. It will be fun!
          </span>
        </li>
      </ul>

      <h2>How to apply</h2>
      <p>
        Fill out the short form
        <a class="inline-link" href={formUrl} target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">here</a>
        (you can choose English or Dutch at the start). We are interested in
        your motivation and expectations.
      </p>
      <p>
        Have questions? Please send an e-mail to
        <a class="inline-link" href="mailto:info@solidara.org">info@solidara.org</a>.
      </p>
      <p>
        <strong>Deadline:</strong> Friday, November 13, 2026, at 12:00 PM. We
        will let you know by Wednesday, November 18, whether you have been
        selected to join.
      </p>
      <p>
        <strong>Privacy:</strong> We use your personal data solely for the
        purpose of this selection process and the project itself. Any
        information you share about yourself will be treated as
        confidential.
      </p>

      <div class="apply-box">
        <a class="button button-accent" href={formUrl} target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">
          Fill out the application form &rarr;
        </a>
      </div>

      <div class="funding">
        <img
          src="/images/eu-erasmus-funding.png"
          alt="Funded by the European Union, Erasmus+"
          height="56"
        />
        <p>
          Funded by the European Union. The views and opinions expressed are
          those of the author(s) only and do not necessarily reflect those of
          the European Union or the Netherlands Youth Institute (Nederlands
          Jeugdinstituut). Neither the European Union nor the granting
          authority can be held responsible for them.
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <style>
    .narrow {
      max-width: 680px;
    }
    .call {
      padding-block: 48px 96px;
    }
    .top-row {
      display: flex;
      justify-content: space-between;
      align-items: baseline;
      gap: 16px;
      flex-wrap: wrap;
      margin-bottom: 24px;
    }
    .back {
      font-size: 13px;
      color: var(--color-teal);
      font-weight: 500;
    }
    .back:hover {
      text-decoration: underline;
    }
    .lang-switch {
      display: flex;
      gap: 14px;
      margin: 0;
      font-size: 13px;
    }
    .lang-switch span {
      color: var(--color-ink);
      font-weight: 500;
    }
    .lang-switch a {
      color: var(--color-teal);
      font-weight: 500;
    }
    .lang-switch a:hover {
      text-decoration: underline;
    }
    .call h1 {
      font-size: 32px;
      margin-bottom: 20px;
    }
    .lead {
      font-size: 17px;
      margin-bottom: 8px;
    }
    .call h2 {
      font-size: 20px;
      margin: 36px 0 14px;
    }
    .call p {
      font-size: 15px;
      margin-bottom: 14px;
    }
    .call .list-intro {
      color: var(--color-ink);
      font-weight: 500;
      margin-bottom: 10px;
    }
    .call strong {
      color: var(--color-ink);
      font-weight: 500;
    }
    .dot-list {
      list-style: none;
      margin: 0 0 16px;
      padding: 0;
      display: flex;
      flex-direction: column;
      gap: 10px;
    }
    .dot-list li {
      display: flex;
      align-items: flex-start;
      gap: 10px;
      font-size: 15px;
      color: var(--color-slate);
    }
    .dot-list .eyebrow-dot {
      margin-top: 9px;
      flex-shrink: 0;
    }
    .num-list {
      list-style: none;
      counter-reset: criteria;
      margin: 0 0 18px;
      padding: 0;
      display: flex;
      flex-direction: column;
      gap: 12px;
    }
    .num-list li {
      counter-increment: criteria;
      display: flex;
      align-items: flex-start;
      gap: 14px;
      font-size: 15px;
      color: var(--color-slate);
    }
    .num-list li::before {
      content: counter(criteria);
      flex-shrink: 0;
      width: 26px;
      height: 26px;
      border-radius: 50%;
      background: rgba(0, 179, 204, 0.12);
      color: var(--color-ink);
      font-family: var(--font-display);
      font-weight: 600;
      font-size: 13px;
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      justify-content: center;
      margin-top: -1px;
    }
    .inline-link {
      color: var(--color-teal);
      font-weight: 500;
      text-decoration: underline;
    }
    .apply-box {
      margin-top: 32px;
      padding-top: 32px;
      border-top: 1px solid var(--color-surface);
    }
    .button-accent {
      background: var(--color-terracotta);
      color: var(--color-white);
    }
    .funding {
      margin-top: 56px;
      padding-top: 32px;
      border-top: 1px solid var(--color-surface);
    }
    .funding img {
      height: 56px;
      width: auto;
      margin-bottom: 16px;
      background: transparent;
    }
    .call .funding p {
      font-size: 12px;
      line-height: 1.6;
    }
  </style>
</BaseLayout>
